{
  "slug": "explore",
  "title": "Explore",
  "description": "A composed page: treeview navigation on the left, live API content and store-driven widgets in the middle.",
  "body": "This page is not coded — it is *composed*: rows of boxes with widgets in them, defined in `content/pages/explore.json` (or in the /admin composer).",
  "layout": {
    "rows": [
      {
        "cells": [
          {
            "span": 1,
            "widgets": [
              {
                "type": "treeview",
                "config": {
                  "title": "Browse",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "label": "Products",
                      "children": [
                        { "label": "Cortex", "href": "/products/cortex" },
                        { "label": "Reflex", "href": "/products/reflex" },
                        { "label": "Relay", "href": "/products/relay" }
                      ]
                    }
                  ],
                  "pagesPrefix": ""
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "span": 2,
            "widgets": [
              {
                "type": "api",
                "config": {
                  "title": "Live from the MusicBrainz API (no relation!)",
                  "url": "https://musicbrainz.org/ws/2/instrument?query=synthesizer&fmt=json&limit=5",
                  "headers": {
                    "User-Agent": "ImprintEngine/0.1 (https://github.com/MarkWestbroek/imprint-engine)"
                  },
                  "itemsPath": "instruments",
                  "fields": [
                    { "label": "Instrument", "path": "name" },
                    { "label": "Type", "path": "type" },
                    { "label": "Description", "path": "description" }
                  ],
                  "limit": 5
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "releases",
                "config": { "title": "Latest releases", "limit": 3 }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "config": {
                  "title": "How this works",
                  "markdown": "Each block on this page is a **widget**: a type name plus a config, validated against the schema the site registered for that type. Want a new kind of block? Add one schema to `src/widgets/registry.ts` and one component to `src/widgets/components.tsx` — then place it on any page in the composer."
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
